paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2194\ufe0f PUSH-BACK PLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the strategic push-back mechanic to control the battlefield. Use it to maintain distance or cunningly push adversaries into environmental hazards or off the arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975930/extras/efab4de57e7e7eb6c1566e63b807ac7e.poster.avif?t=1755225932\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975930/extras/efab4de57e7e7eb6c1566e63b807ac7e.webm?t=1755225932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975930/extras/efab4de57e7e7eb6c1566e63b807ac7e.mp4?t=1755225932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
